WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.907
"I have a treat for you," Mom said.

2
00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:13.102
"We're visiting a dairy farm this afternoon."

3
00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:17.401
"Yay!" Oliver shouted.

4
00:00:17.402 --> 00:00:21.551
"That sounds fun!" Emmy said.

5
00:00:21.552 --> 00:00:25.271
Harry wasn't interested in the farm.

6
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:29.924
But he got into the car anyway.

7
00:00:29.925 --> 00:00:35.295
The Carters arrived at the dairy farm.

8
00:00:35.296 --> 00:00:39.905
They saw the cows in the field.

9
00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:45.346
"Let's go see the calves," Emmy said.

10
00:00:45.347 --> 00:00:49.602
The Carters found the calves in their pens.

11
00:00:49.603 --> 00:00:54.383
"They look so cute!" Emmy said.

12
00:00:54.384 --> 00:01:00.240
"I wish I could take one home!"

13
00:01:00.241 --> 00:01:06.117
"This is boring, and I'm hot," Harry said.

14
00:01:06.118 --> 00:01:10.884
Soon Oliver noticed the field was empty.

15
00:01:10.885 --> 00:01:15.100
"Where did the cows go?" he asked.

16
00:01:15.101 --> 00:01:19.114
"It must be milking time," Dad said.

17
00:01:19.115 --> 00:01:24.033
"Let's watch the cows being milked."

18
00:01:24.034 --> 00:01:27.879
"Ugh," Harry said.

19
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:32.153
"I don't care about cows or milk."

20
00:01:32.154 --> 00:01:36.220
Oliver tried to cheer up his brother.

21
00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:40.565
"Maybe these cows give chocolate milk!"

22
00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:44.287
Harry shook his head.

23
00:01:44.288 --> 00:01:49.423
"Cows don't give chocolate milk."

24
00:01:49.424 --> 00:01:54.536
At the milking barn, the Carters looked through a window.

25
00:01:54.537 --> 00:02:03.661
Farmers were milking cows with machines.

26
00:02:03.662 --> 00:02:08.426
"Is it time to go home?" Harry asked.

27
00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:15.911
"No, it's time to visit the farm shop," Mom said.

28
00:02:15.912 --> 00:02:20.417
Soon Harry was happily eating an ice cream cone.

29
00:02:20.418 --> 00:02:23.504
"Mmm," he said.

30
00:02:23.505 --> 00:02:31.295
"I like cows—when their milk makes ice cream!"

